# Decor bush, native 32x24 frames: idle, brush1 (leaning with the hero), brush2 (rebound), settle.
# The runtime mirrors the sheet for the hero's heading, so the lean is drawn once. Bottom row rests on the floor.
# Decor tier (D76, #344): muted grey-green, contour in its own darker green, no ink 0b0814, no accent hue.
# Night palette (D92, #430): every colour mixed 35 % toward the night background 2c3f66; the day values are in docs/ART_DIRECTION.md.
size 32 24
color k 415558
color d 495f5e
color m 526763
color l 5b7069
color n 666b5d
color N 525852
frame idle
